"""Camera and acting board for an original three-minute performance."""
from board_seed import EP,CAST,seeds,shot,save
from pathlib import Path
SHOT=[]
def add(n,b,c,f,why,line,blocking,ref):
 base="Locked eye-level 45 mm single cinematic shot, normal-speed blocking, prompt response. "
 if f=="two_shot_ots":base+="Keep actor and receiving person in the SAME unbroken frame for the exchange; both identifiable by face OR distinctive shoulder, collar and hands. Never cut away into singles. Show a real personal reaction. "
 if f=="action_insert":base+="Close action, wide enough to follow a continuous connection from the actor's distinctive garment sleeve and skin to the object being handled. "
 if line:base+="The ONLY spoken words in this take are: \""+line+"\". Deliver the entire line naturally, without long gaps, within 1–6 seconds. "
 else:base+="No speech. Concentrate on one completely legible physical action. "
 SHOT.append(shot(n,b,c,f,why,line,base+blocking,ref))
add(2,"B01","AG","two_shot_ots","Alma refuses to be diminished when her drawings hit the floor.","Those are six months of my life.","Low three-quarter two shot. Loose cream paper already lies on the floor. LEFT Alma bends once for ONE page; RIGHT Gavin slowly covers that page with the toe of his clean black shoe before her brown fingers reach it. She stops, looks directly up at him and says the line. She stands without the sheet, hurt but defiant. Gavin smirks. No new slap or new fall.","ag.jpg")
add(3,"B01","GA","two_shot_ots","Gavin declares the price of stealing authorship.","Forty coats. My name gets the check. Yours gets swept up.","Gavin on the right looks down at the scattered sheets and then into Alma's eyes, points to his own chest. The teal apron of Alma at left stays visible as she looks over at the blue coat. Gavin savors the last word. He has deliberately engineered this theft. End before he touches the coat.","ag.jpg")
add(4,"B02","GA","two_shot_ots","He physically removes the maker's identity from the entry.","","At the left lapel of the royal-blue wool coat on the tan dress form, Gavin on RIGHT pinches a narrow plain CREAM cloth maker's label with his fair fingers and tears it free in a single clear action. Alma is LEFT, a hand still extended toward him; she sees what he's doing. No scissors, no injury. Keep the camera at chest height in a shared medium shot. End on the detached strip hanging in Gavin's hand, coat still blue.","ag.jpg")
add(5,"B02","GA","two_shot_ots","The threat makes speaking up cost Alma her livelihood.","Tell the buyer and you'll never work in this room again.","Gavin stands between Alma and the blue coat, holds the already loose cream label in plain sight, then bunches it in his fist as he threatens her. Alma bares her empty palms and looks past him at the mirror. Only Gavin speaks. Keep his face right and her anxious face left; no other person. Small brisk movement, normal cadence.","ag.jpg")
add(6,"B02","AG","two_shot_ots","Alma plants proof he cannot simply peel off the costume.","My mother put her mark inside every coat. So do I.","From just behind Gavin's right burgundy shoulder, Alma, full clear face and copper shirt under dark teal apron, turns to the still-closed royal-blue lapel. With her own brown index finger she traces one diagonal seam on the OUTSIDE. She keeps the coat closed; the audience will see the inside later. She returns her gaze to him, not backing away. He blocks her way without touching her.","ag.jpg")
add(7,"B02","GA","action_insert","Gavin substitutes his own brand in full view of the audience.","","Stay continuous on the fair hand emerging from the burgundy blazer's white shirt cuff. A BLACK satin rectangular brand tag is already on his palm. He clips it onto the royal-blue lapel with a small silver clothing clip, deliberately covering the place where the cream tag was. The still blue coat stays on tan mannequin, camera does not look inside. Tilt a few inches with his wrist and settle as his fingers let go. No text needed.","ag.jpg")
add(9,"B03","GN","two_shot_ots","Asked to name the maker, he lies to the person able to pay him.","I designed it. She just holds the pins.","A true over-the-shoulder across the back of Nina's navy blazer and edge of her black bob, LEFT foreground, toward Gavin in burgundy at RIGHT. His face is clearly visible. He steps beside the already closed coat, touches the black tag on the outside and claims all the work. Flicks a finger toward Alma OFF CAMERA. Nina's head turns slowly toward his finger. Never show an anonymous extra.","gavin.jpg")
add(10,"B03","AN","two_shot_ots","Alma chooses to speak even though her job was threatened.","He tore off my label. Ask him what's under the left lapel.","OTS past Nina's navy shoulder and bob in right foreground. Alma is left and faces the commissioner with steady gaze and firm posture. Alma makes an open-palmed gesture toward the left lapel of the closed royal-blue garment. She does not touch the coat or unfold a drawing. Her sentence invites a test anybody here can witness.","alma.jpg")
add(11,"B03","NG","two_shot_ots","The buyer pins Gavin to an answer before anyone can see the lining.","Your design, Mr. Hale. What's underneath?","Nina in navy is in focus left of center. The back of Gavin's burgundy shoulder and white collar occupy the right foreground. Nina slowly turns the CLOSED blue garment just enough to face him, keeps it closed, both hands well away from the seam. She asks him with a measured even look, then stops. Gavin's shoulder stiffens. No other speakers.","nina.jpg")
add(12,"B03","GN","two_shot_ots","Gavin's contempt makes him commit to a false answer.","Plain silk. Turn it inside out if you like.","OTS over Nina's navy shoulder at left. Gavin in burgundy right of the blue coat in focus. Looking straight at the buyer, he shrugs with false confidence then spreads both empty hands. He does not touch the coat. The color on his face drains slightly as soon as he finishes, yet he refuses to yield. End with his hands clear of the blue lapel.","gavin.jpg")
add(13,"B03","GA","two_shot_ots","To prevent the test he publicly tries to take the evidence away.","Pack it up. The fitting's over.","In a shared waist-up shot Gavin grabs a plain BLACK garment bag from the workbench and throws it over the TOP of the royal-blue coat and tan dress form, obscuring the garment in one swift theatrical motion. He orders the fitting over. Alma at left takes one deliberate step in front of the wheeled rack and stops it from moving. Finish with the bag draped over the coat, neither person leaves. No bodily contact.","ag.jpg")
add(14,"B04","AG","two_shot_ots","Alma risks being fired rather than let him remove the evidence.","Fire me, then. The coat stays.","Alma is on LEFT in front of the wheeled stand with one hand firmly on its rail; Gavin burgundy RIGHT within arm's reach. Alma speaks to him directly. She takes the already draped black garment bag in her brown hands and peels it OFF the stand in one unbroken movement revealing royal blue underneath, drops the black bag to the bench. Her copper sleeves maintain contact all the way. Gavin lets go of the rail. No applause.","ag.jpg")
add(15,"B04","AN","two_shot_ots","She gives a specific falsifiable description before the lining opens.","A gold crane. Under the left lapel. Open it yourself.","Across Nina's navy shoulder at right foreground, Alma in teal and copper at left. Alma holds BOTH dark-brown hands away from the CLOSED royal-blue coat. She names the hidden bird and invites the buyer to check it herself, then steps half a pace back, holding Nina's gaze. This is a prediction, keep the lining off screen until the following shot.","alma.jpg")
add(16,"B04","N","action_insert","Nina independently exposes what Gavin swore was plain.","","Nina, wearing her NAVY blazer and ivory blouse, at the royal-blue wool coat on tan mannequin; frame her upper body, sleeves and BOTH light-tan hands in one shot. She catches the LEFT royal-blue lapel with its small black satin brand tag and folds the lapel OPEN, toward camera. The inside cream lining has a single large unmistakable GOLD EMBROIDERED LONG-NECKED CRANE BIRD, spread wings, gold thread gleaming in daylight. Hold the opened coat wide with the bright gold embroidered bird visible. No other hands, no text, no other costume. Do not close the lapel.","nina.jpg")
add(17,"B04","NA","two_shot_ots","The buyer says out loud what everyone can now verify.","A gold crane. Right where you said.","Nina front three-quarter in navy, facing Alma's copper sleeve and teal shoulder in the left edge in a true OTS. Nina moves her eyes from the ALREADY OPEN cream lining on the blue coat to Alma. Two people watch the same revealed evidence. Nina says the words with quiet recognition. The coat remains open; no reaching into pockets or unveiling it a second time.","nina.jpg")
add(18,"B05","GA","two_shot_ots","Gavin changes his lie: even if Alma made it, he claims she belongs to him.","She sews for me. That bird belongs to me too.","Shared two shot. Facing the open space before the commissioner OFF SCREEN, Gavin stands shoulder to shoulder with Alma near the oak bench. He points at Alma's teal apron while he speaks; his voice goes brittle with anger. Alma looks at him in disbelief but keeps her chin up. Frame their faces and shoulders, garment offscreen to keep the reveal continuous. He is still fighting to take the full order.","ag.jpg")
add(19,"B05","AN","two_shot_ots","The commission would finance more unpaid work unless Alma speaks.","Last winter he sold twelve of mine. I never saw a cent.","From Nina's navy shoulder, Alma faces her. Her voice is level. She flattens her palm on the workbench, names the earlier loss, and holds the commissioner's gaze. Brief catch of breath after saying 'mine'; next words come promptly. Her brown fingers stay connected to copper sleeves. No tears, other patrons, or cutaway.","alma.jpg")
add(20,"B05","GN","two_shot_ots","He offers Nina a share of the fraud and exposes his motive in her hearing.","Sign with me. Ten percent stays in your pocket.","Over Nina's navy shoulder in left foreground. Gavin's face and burgundy jacket visible at right. He leans in, lowers his voice and pushes the CLOSED navy contract folder toward her with two fingers, offering her a kickback. Stop his hand when the folder reaches her. His eyes check that Alma is out of earshot, but she is not shown. Nina keeps both hands still. End on the public buyer's silent refusal to take his offer.","gavin.jpg")
add(21,"B05","NG","two_shot_ots","Nina forces him to repeat the bribe where the maker can hear.","Say it louder. I want the woman you stole from to hear.","Nina in focus in navy, facing the side of Gavin's burgundy shoulder in the near foreground. She slides the folder back toward him just two inches, turns her body so Alma in the room can hear, and says the line. Gavin freezes at the word 'stole'. Frame tight enough to exclude the rest of the room. No other voices.","nina.jpg")
add(22,"B05","GA","two_shot_ots","The villain doubles down while the witness can finally stop him.","You walk out now and your whole shop walks with you.","Gavin turns from the buyer toward Alma and blocks the exit in the edge of the bright room with his arm resting on the doorframe. Alma in teal, clearly present, holds her position. He speaks tightly, trying to frighten her one last time. No physical contact or lunge, no shouting crowd, no premature apology. End on Alma's measured refusal to flinch.","ag.jpg")
add(23,"B06","NG","two_shot_ots","Nina withdraws his authority and the whole order, where the maker can hear.","You're off the tour, Gavin. Leave your badge on the table.","Over burgundy shoulder and the edge of Gavin's ear in the near RIGHT foreground, Nina at LEFT. She stands firmly in the center of the exit, extends her EMPTY palm to him, points to the oak workbench. The navy dossier is still shut and her hand does not touch him. She delivers the verdict with finality, not pity. His raised burgundy shoulder lowers. Alma is her audience offscreen.","nina.jpg")
add(24,"B06","GA","two_shot_ots","He physically surrenders the badge he used to intimidate Alma.","","Shared profile medium. Gavin alone removes the small plain silver SQUARE lapel badge from his burgundy jacket with his fair fingers, puts it on the honey oak workbench, and takes his empty hand off it. Alma at left in rust and teal watches without touching the badge. Gavin looks down, mortified. No one picks the badge back up. No words or applause. Hold on the fallen status and witnessing face.","ag.jpg")
add(25,"B06","AN","two_shot_ots","Nina gives the order directly to the person who made the sample.","Forty coats. Your name on every one.","Across Alma's teal shoulder and small black curls at left foreground. Nina in navy holds the previously closed navy contract folder across the workbench, OFFERING it to Alma's dark-brown hands with rust cuffs. Keep the real exchange inside one frame with both women visible. Nina says the line plainly and places the folder in Alma's hands. Alma takes it. No money, no signing, no extra witnesses.","nina.jpg")
add(26,"B06","AG","two_shot_ots","Alma returns his own words on her terms after he actually lost the job.","Know your place.","Face-to-face two shot. Alma at left in copper and teal now stands tall at the workbench with the CLOSED navy contract folder held to her chest. Gavin at right in burgundy has lowered eyes and open empty hands; his old power is gone. Alma looks him straight in the eye and says his exact words, clearly and only once: 'Know your place.' Gavin looks away, visibly stung. Hold on Alma, clear controlled triumph, no laugh track, no other words.","ag.jpg")
add(27,"B06","A","close_up_180","Finish on the same woman insulted in the first frame owning the order.","","Bright intimate eye-level close-up on Alma in copper shirt and dark teal apron. She places her closed navy contract folder on the oak bench beside the royal-blue coat, straightens the collar with her own brown hands, then raises her eyes to face the room. Let a small deeply earned smile cross her face. Finish and stay on Alma's triumphant face. No new actor, no singing, no audience, absolutely no speech. One stable lens.","alma.jpg")
cards=sorted(seeds+SHOT,key=lambda c:c["id"])
assert len(cards)==27 and all(c["story_order"]==i for i,c in enumerate(cards,1))
timings=[8,8,9, 6,7,6,5,7, 6,7,7,6,8, 7,7,7,7, 6,6,6,5,5, 7,6,7,7,7]
speakers="G A G - G A - N G A N G G A A - N G A G N G N - N A -".split()
assert len(speakers)==len(timings)==len(cards) and sum(timings)==180
for card,seconds,speaker in zip(cards,timings,speakers):
 card.update(duration_seconds=seconds,speaker=speaker if speaker!="-" else None)
if __name__=="__main__":save("shots.json",cards)
